# Scene1-3-b1

; ========================================
; ●シーン1-3-b1
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:19_2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_22_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:（这说不定是什么线索……）|#0103Bad01_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛全神贯注地不停挖掘。<br>过了一会，出现了一个小小的黑色团块。|#0103Bad01_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:这是什么呢。|#0103Bad01_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

; カチリという音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_92 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛刚轻轻拿起它，<br>黑块就发出了微弱的声响。|#0103Bad01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……？|#0103Bad01_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; 爆発音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_93 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:一声震天动地的巨响过后，<br>现场只剩下了——|#0103Bad01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor

[PrintTextModified Text:散落一地的，曾经是艾玛的残骸碎片。|#0103Bad01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

